        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana G2RLDB, Regular Replacement Latch for Deadbolts</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Replacement Deadbolt Latch is available in 2-3/4\" or 2-3/8\" backsets. Choose from either polished brass or brushed chrome finishes. This Regular Replacement Latch for Deadbolts is made out of long-lasting steel for strength. It has a 1\" throw.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-G2RLDB-specifications.gif?v=1704354708\" width=\"569\" height=\"197\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana G2RLDB G2 Regular Latch Deadbolt Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Commercial Deadbolt Latch:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Steel / Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Throw: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Faceplate: Square Corner</li>\r\n<li>Faceplate Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Faceplate Length: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Faceplate Length c.c.: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Available as a 2-3/4\" Backset or a 2-3/8\" Backset</li>\r\n<li>UL Listed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-G2RLDB-specifications.pdf?v=1704262320\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana G2RLDB G2 Regular Latch Deadbolt Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
